+---
+'@tanstack/charts': minor
+---
+
+Add `contourLines` to `@tanstack/charts/spatial/contour`. It strokes scalar-grid
+level sets as iso-lines, dropping ring edges along the grid border and beside
+missing samples, and keeps unbroken interior rings closed.
